==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|да́льше|pos=com}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-дальше.ogg}}

===Adverb===
{{ru-comparative|да́льше}}

# {{comparative of|ru|POS=adjective|далёкий}}: [[further]]
# {{comparative of|ru|POS=adverb|далеко́}}: [[further]]
#: {{uxi|ru|Да́льше!|Continue!}}

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|ru|пода́льше}}

===Adverb===
{{ru-adv|да́льше}}

# [[furthermore]]
# [[then]]; [[next]]; [[afterwards]]
#: {{syn|ru|зате́м|пото́м|в дальне́йшем}}

====Usage notes====
* The adverbs {{m|ru||да́льше}} and {{m|ru|до́лго}} follow imperfective verbs.
